TEXT 0 -448 Left 4 ;OPEN_PHASE - 07 - Measurement quality : ESC waveforms through the phase U and battery channels
TEXT 0 -376 Left 2 ;The phase voltage, the motor current, the DC bus voltage and the battery current are the reference. run_simulations.py compares them with what the AD7606C pins see.
TEXT -232 152 Left 1 ;ESC phase U\n(J1 pin 1)
TEXT 784 -88 Left 1 ;Motor phase U (J2 pin 3): inductance, resistance, back-EMF around Vbat / 2
TEXT 144 -88 Left 1 ;PBV-R001 shunt, L_SH = its inductance (datasheet: < 10 nH)
TEXT 1232 200 Left 1 ;AD7606C-18 V8+ / V8- input pins\n(RIN 1.2 Meg to an internal 2 V node, CIN 5 pF)
TEXT 0 -216 Left 3 ;CURRENT CHANNEL  (phase U : R1, IC2, R15, C25, R16 -> AD7606C V8)
TEXT 1232 696 Left 1 ;AD7606C-18 V7+ / V7- input pins\n(RIN 1.2 Meg to an internal 2 V node, CIN 5 pF)
TEXT 0 664 Left 3 ;VOLTAGE CHANNEL  (phase U : R17, R18, Re1, C31, R19 -> AD7606C V7)
TEXT -400 616 Left 1 ;Ideal analog rails\n(see 02 for the real ones)
TEXT 2352 152 Left 1 ;Battery and its leads\n(resistance and inductance: assumed)
TEXT 3584 -88 Left 1 ;ESC: input capacitor (assumed) and DC side of the three half-bridges
TEXT 2944 -88 Left 1 ;PBV-R001 shunt, L_SHB = its inductance (datasheet: < 10 nH)
TEXT 4032 200 Left 1 ;AD7606C-18 V2+ / V2- input pins\n(RIN 1.2 Meg to an internal 2 V node, CIN 5 pF)
TEXT 2800 -216 Left 3 ;CURRENT CHANNEL  (battery B : R9, IC10, R30, C42, R31 -> AD7606C V2)
TEXT 4032 696 Left 1 ;AD7606C-18 V1+ / V1- input pins\n(RIN 1.2 Meg to an internal 2 V node, CIN 5 pF)
TEXT 2800 664 Left 3 ;VOLTAGE CHANNEL  (battery B : R32, R33, Re4, C40, R34 -> AD7606C V1)
TEXT 3584 120 Left 1 ;B_ESC: the DC bus supplies the power that the three half-bridges deliver to the phases
TEXT 2540 1144 Left 3 ;PHASES V AND W  (power path only, to load the DC bus)
TEXT 2540 1208 Left 1 ;Same PWM and same motor phase as U, 120 and 240 degrees later.\nL_MV, L_MW and R_MV, R_MW include the shunts R4 and R7.
TEXT -400 1040 Left 1 ;PWM modulator: sine reference (MOD) against a triangle carrier (CAR)
TEXT -400 1120 Left 2 !.tran 0 8m 0 50n uic\n.options plotwinsize=0\n.step param Lsh list 1p 5n 10n
TEXT -400 1250 Left 2 !.param Vbat=25.2 fpwm=24k fe=1k m=0.774 phi=22.7 kedge=200\n.param Lm=30u Rm=50m Eb=8\n.param Rb=20m Lb=300n Cdc=470u Resr=30m
TEXT -400 1390 Left 2 ;6S battery, 24 kHz PWM, 1 kHz electrical frequency. Three runs: shunts without inductance, 5 nH, 10 nH.\n20 A peak in phase with the back-EMF: 90 W in each phase, PWM ripple of about 8 A pp.\nDC bus: battery and leads 20 mOhm / 300 nH, ESC input capacitor 470 uF / 30 mOhm.\nThese four values are assumed (no battery or ESC is specified in the project).
TEXT 720 1120 Left 2 !.save V(IN-U) V(OUT-U) I(L_M) V(V8+) V(V8-) V(V7+) V(V7-)\n.save V(OUT-B) I(L_BAT) V(V2+) V(V2-) V(V1+) V(V1-)
